<title>USA: Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were fully steady. Trading was fairly active.</p>
<p>Steers - select to mostly choice 2-4 1100-1300 lbs 62.50-64.50. Select 60.00-62.50.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to mainly choice 2-4 1000-1200 lbs 62.00-64.50. Select 60.00-62.00.</p>
</text>
